            "description": "**参数解释**:\n用户Token。\n通过调用IAM服务[获取用户token](https://support.huaweicloud.com/intl/zh-cn/api-iam/iam_30_0001.html)。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及。\n**取值范围**:\n不涉及。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。",
            "type": "string",
            "required": true,
            "x-example": "******"
          },
          {
            "name": "project_id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n租户在某一Region下的项目ID。\n获取方法请参见[获取项目ID](https://support.huaweicloud.com/api-gaussdb/gaussdb_api_196.html)。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及。\n**取值范围**:\n只能由英文字母、数字组成,且长度为32个字符。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "x-example": "4f07d3f50ce2466a9a7c014337b36409"
          },
          {
            "name": "instance_id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n实例ID,此参数是用户创建实例的唯一标识。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及。\n**取值范围**:\n只能由英文字母、数字组成,且长度为36个字符。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "x-example": "7912cd1077b2413fbd6f39a044777537in14"
          },
          {
            "name": "task_scope",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "限流任务范围,目前支持SQL,SESSION。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "x-example": "SQL"
          },
          {
            "name": "limit_type",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "限流类型,支持SQL_ID、SQL_TYPE、SESSION_ACTIVE_MAX_COUNT类型。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "x-example": "SQL_ID"
          },
          {
            "name": "limit_type_value",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "限流类型值,支持模糊匹配。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "x-example": "select"
          },
          {
            "name": "task_name",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "限流任务名,支持模糊匹配。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "x-example": "select"
          },
          {
            "name": "sql_model",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "sql模板,支持模糊匹配。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "x-example": "select"
          },
          {
            "name": "rule_name",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "规则名。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "x-example": "12"
          },
          {
            "name": "start_time",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "限流任务开始时间,格式为yyyy-mm-ddThh:mm:ssZ,当前时间指UTC时间。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "x-example": "2023-06-06T01:47:20+0800"
          },
          {
            "name": "end_time",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "限流任务结束时间,格式为yyyy-mm-ddThh:mm:ssZ,当前时间指UTC时间。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "x-example": "2023-06-07T01:47:20+0800"
          },
          {
            "name": "offset",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "索引位置,偏移量。从第一条数据偏移offset条数据后开始查询,默认为0(偏移0条数据,表示从第一条数据开始查询),必须为数字,不能为负数。\n\n取值范围:0 - 10000",
            "required": false,
            "type": "integer",
            "x-example": "10"
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "查询记录数。默认为10,不能为负数,最小值为1,最大值为100。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "integer",
            "x-example": "10"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "成功。",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/ListLimitTaskResponseBody"
            },
            "examples": {
              "application/json": {
                "list": [
                  {
                    "task_id": "59b6a1a278844ac48119d86512e0000",
                    "task_scope": "SQL",
                    "limit_type": "SQL_ID",
                    "limit_type_value": "39b6a1a",
